+## Version 8.5.1
+
+Unreleased
+
+- Add the {class}`Duration` parameter type, used as `type=click.Duration()`.
+  It converts a whole number of seconds such as `120`, or unit groups such
+  as `2d`, `1h30m`, or `1d2h3m4s`, to a {class}`datetime.timedelta`. Its
+  metavar is `DURATION`.
+
